  "synonym_discrimination": {
    "words": [
      "middle-n",
      "center-n"
    ],
    "note": "**Middle** is the general area between the edges or ends of something, and it is also the usual word for time: *in the middle of the room*, *in the middle of the night*. **Center** is more exact: it is the point or small area in the very middle, especially of a round shape, and it is the word for some buildings and places with a purpose: *the center of the circle*, *a shopping center*. **Center** is rarely used for time."
  },
