      "note": "Use **in the middle of**, for both places and times."
    }
  ],
  "etymology": null,
  "see_also": [],
  "adaptation": {
    "semantic": "\"middle\": many languages use one word for **middle** and **center**. In English, **middle** is the usual word for time (*in the middle of the night*), and **center**, not **middle**, names some buildings and places (*a sports center*).",
